[65.598094, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(0.818148ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[65.598398, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.677965ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.467538ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.247373ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.113014ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(3.3085ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[65.598798, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(1.367967ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.231968ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[65.612997, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ a Paygate replay of an older delivery is accepted once (docs/SPEC.md, Replays) \u001b[90m(28.477138ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
